      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open Missions",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In <strong>Drones</strong>, tap <strong>Missions</strong>. <strong>Active</strong> lists every unit's missions until their sortie ends.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/03e23798a640116d.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open a mission",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap a mission for its team, drone and window. <strong>Show on map</strong> moves the map to it.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/675eeceda1f7ba62.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Cancel it",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Before the drone is up, <strong>Cancel mission</strong> stops it. It asks once and tells the team.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/06cd539203a39a7a.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See it finished",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The mission moves to <strong>Finished</strong>. The request goes back to the team.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/ee82e784feccca67.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
